    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0003",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "Notes:\n*Advice given in this table is partly derived from manufacturers’ information and available published data and partly \ntheoretical. There are several factors that affect individual drug handling and caution is required in every instance \nCross taper cautiously – usually over 2–4 weeks as per example\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        371.92041015625,
        420.2626647949219,
        410.6654052734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "379262dc229783fe6e250a7143ce7b23b0be03d3e712f1239a11a822e1678337"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0004",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "aAgomelatine has no effect on monoamine uptake and no affinity for α, β adrenergic, histaminergic, cholinergic, \ndopaminergic and benzodiazepine receptors. The potential for interactions between agomelatine and other \nantidepressants is low and it is not expected to mitigate discontinuation reactions of other antidepressants. Some \ncrossover with other antidepressants might be cautiously attempted when switching from agomelatine.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        411.3791809082031,
        411.40130615234375,
        450.6641845703125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e9eed0160e57a2c33109ca7e828e305f8cd8b6341cb7ba397fc26bc039d1dc7d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "bBupropion is licensed for smoking cessation but unlicensed for the treatment of depression in the UK. It is a \nCYP2D6 inhibitor and particular caution required when cross-tapering with drugs metabolised by this enzyme.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        451.9642028808594,
        399.7361755371094,
        470.669189453125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "da9a34c03e439add7878f538a90df6fcec2616d7afc599e893b93e6f9d0d0f83"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "cBeware: interactions with fluoxetine may still occur for 5 weeks after stopping fluoxetine because of its metabolite’s \nlong half-life.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.99879837036133,
        471.9642028808594,
        421.0789489746094,
        490.669189453125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "436dad0e50ce57a058c3c539e47e58b15e8f7cb0467c900a64807806389f5e8a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "dFluvoxamine is a potent inhibitor of CYP1A2, and to a lesser extent of CYP2C and CYP3A4 and has a high \npotential for interactions hence extra precaution is required.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        491.9642028808594,
        392.1911926269531,
        510.669189453125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c86755837253958938db93e329ae1630bdbb014cb7e56c61caec36d9fc7ea4e9"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "eSwitching to reboxetine as antidepressant monotherapy is no longer recommended.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        511.9642028808594,
        318.1611633300781,
        520.6716918945312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "cf2ad11cee9c4f5e82a589ca12f669428f3570ab7073afb1b1def5f009ad2888"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "fCitalopram, escitalopram, paroxetine and sertraline.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        521.9641723632812,
        214.74098205566406,
        530.6716918945312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d547b4169d8f0f1461823fdb4f36c4a96d51d7754dbf829c4a8de83daf8732d2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "gLimited experience with vortioxetine and extra precaution required. Particular care when switching to or from \nbupropion and other CYP2D6 inhibitors such as fluoxetine and paroxetine.9\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        531.9641723632812,
        401.0110778808594,
        550.669189453125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f5d3ff4bc084acd187684affbda932e2e91c25b67c92902eb95855536e5d1956"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "h Wait 3 weeks in the case of vortioxetine.10\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.99969482421875,
        551.9641723632812,
        187.10430908203125,
        560.6716918945312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "548273022433c33a8fbbf582d22773491cc4e19cf30344cea2645ca6db5ee4fd"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0362-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "i Abrupt switch from SSRIs and venlafaxine to duloxetine is possible starting at 60mg/day.5\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.00196838378906,
        561.9641723632812,
        334.7861328125,
        570.6716918945312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5964e56fd4971014a5d7bbe77a6db7d00ff3c72b3ce3b871b0e3993c1160efb9"
    },
    {
